  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advisory and supervision services for BEGIN component I: Blueprint</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Advisory and supervision services to ensure that Component I of the Begin programme is implemented in line with the Financing Agreement and with the Strategic priorities of the Blueprint for Regulatory Reform. Begin component I supports the ministry of Industry and Trade to implement the Blueprint for Regulatory Reform through a programme estimate.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
